  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe list of public identifiers that correspond to the DTD in [14.2](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/xhtml.html#parsing-xhtml-documents) includes the public ID for XHTML Basic 1.0, but not 1.1.\n\nThere doesn't appear to be a particular reason for this omission; version 1.1 doesn't specify any entity declarations not already present in 13.5. The missing public ID can be added without any other change.",
